# Quarter Past: a clock face -- a ring of hour marks, and hands round the
# centre pointing a quarter-turn apart.

NAME Quarter Past
SYMMETRY ROT4
WALLS K Y
START 20 20 SE

# The hour marks at twelve and between: short dashes round the face.
MOVE 15 4
DRAW 15 6
MOVE 7 9
DRAW 7 7
DRAW 9 7

# The hand: from near the centre out towards twelve.
MOVE 16 9
DRAW 16 11
